#   commit=  the pinned commit, a full sha
#   tree=    sha256 of the manifest of the copied files at that commit: one `MODE SHA1 PATH` line per file (git's blob id), sorted (LC_ALL=C)
#   path=    a copied path (a directory or a file), the same path in both repositories
